pinatlas-data
=============

The JSON files under data/ are converted, re-formatted technical information about
STMicroelectronics microcontrollers. They are not authored here.

Primary source
--------------
LibrePCB/stm-db  https://github.com/LibrePCB/stm-db
  Data files are generated with STM8CubeMX / STM32CubeMX. That repository's README states the
  data "only contain[s] technical information that could also be obtained from the datasheets
  and probably do[es] not fall under copyright". Its scripts are MIT licensed.

Enrichment source
-----------------
embassy-rs/stm32-data-generated  https://github.com/embassy-rs/stm32-data-generated
  Generated output of embassy-rs/stm32-data. The generated repository ships no LICENSE file;
  the underlying device data (alternate-function numbers, registers, RCC/interrupt/DMA
  metadata, memory layout) is derived from ST documentation.

